      "content": "that looks good. can you make it a bit more formal though? maybe add something about the legal obligation they have to maintain the heating system and mention that i'll have to look into rent reduction if it isnt fixed soon. keep it strictly business like a proper german business letter.",
      "source": "evaluator"
