    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "*Guten Tag* [Hausverwaltung Name],\n\nI must formally advise you regarding the critical malfunction of the heating system in my residence at [Your Address], specifically the non-operational radiator in the living room. As the current ambient temperatures are dropping, this failure constitutes a breach of the landlord's obligation to provide a habitable living environment, a requirement under German tenancy law. I expect this issue to be rectified with the utmost urgency, as a prolonged lack of heat will leave me no choice but to investigate potential claims for rent reduction (*Mietminderung*).\n\nI await your immediate confirmation of the scheduled repair date.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Apartment Number]\n[Your Contact Information]\n\n*(Note: While this is more formal, remember to check local Berlin regulations for the precise legal phrasing regarding rent reduction, as the legal specifics are often more complex than a simple threat!)*",
